  "summary": "pypdf has possible infinite loop when cloning dictionaries",
  "details": "### Impact\n\nAn attacker who uses this vulnerability can craft a PDF which leads to an infinite loop. This requires cloning/duplicating a `DictionaryObject`.\n\n### Patches\n\nThis has been fixed in [pypdf==6.21.4](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/releases/tag/6.21.4).\n\n### Workarounds\n\nIf you cannot upgrade yet, consider applying the changes from PR [#4288](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/4288).",
